{
  "id": 503281363,
  "iid": 25650,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "epan: Handle base64url encoding padding being optional",
  "description": "Unlike the standard base64 encoding, in base64url encoding padding\nwith '=' is optional:\n\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc4648/#section-5\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc4648/#section-3.2\n\nAnd in certain uses, like DNS over HTTP, padding MUST NOT be\nincluded:\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc8484/#section-6\n\nHandle that in our base64url decoding function.\n\nPing #21384",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-07-04T04:28:28.134Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-07-04T14:46:00.261Z",
